    "id": "DG.def.spaceCurve",
    "kind": "definition",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Space Curve",
        "zh-CN": "空间曲线"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@a@DG.ctxt.abReal,Real),Type.annotation(@b@DG.ctxt.abReal,Real),Type.annotation(@$\\gamma$@DG.ctxt.gammaCurve,Type.to(Icc(a,b),LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$)))),structure[prop](DG.def.spaceCurve[text]($\\gamma$,Icc(a,b)),__enum__[enumerate](member[colon](DG.SpaceCurve.smoothness[text],ContDiffOn[default]($\\infty$,$\\gamma$,Icc(a,b))),member[colon](DG.SpaceCurve.regularity[text],Logic.forall-typed(@t,Real,Logic.implies(Set.Mem[authored](,Icc(a,b),t),Ne[authored_Neq_default](,Type.apply(Analysis.deriv($\\gamma$),t),$0$)))))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "A **space curve** is a smooth (that is, $C^{\\infty}$) map $\\gamma\\colon [a,b]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{3}$. If in addition $\\gamma'(t)\\neq 0$ for every $t\\in[a,b]$, then $\\gamma$ is called **regular**, and a smooth map with this property is called a **regular smooth curve**.",
          "zh-CN": "**空间曲线**是光滑（即 $C^{\\infty}$）映射 $\\gamma\\colon [a,b]\\to\\mathbb{R}^{3}$。若进一步对每个 $t\\in[a,b]$ 都有 $\\gamma'(t)\\neq 0$，则称 $\\gamma$ 为**正则**的；具有该性质的光滑映射称为**正则光滑曲线**。"
        }
      }
    },
    "package": "DifferentialGeometry",
